<section aria-label="Cookie settings" class="cookie-settings-panel" data-cookie-panel="" hidden="">
<h2>Cookie settings</h2>
<p>Necessary cookies keep this site working. Analytics cookies help us understand page visits.</p>
<label><input data-cookie-analytics="" type="checkbox"/> Allow analytics cookies</label>
<button data-cookie-action="save" type="button">Save settings</button>
</section>
<aside aria-label="Cookie consent" class="cookie-banner" data-cookie-banner="" hidden="" role="banner">
<p>We use cookies on our website to see how you interact with it. By accepting, you agree to our use of such cookies. <a href="https://www.cameronco.com.au/privacy-policy" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a></p>
<div class="cookie-actions">
<button class="link-button" data-cookie-action="settings" type="button">Settings</button>
<button data-cookie-action="decline" type="button">Decline All</button>
<button class="accept" data-cookie-action="accept" type="button">Accept</button>
<button aria-label="Close cookie banner" class="close" data-cookie-action="close" type="button">✕</button>
</div>
</aside>
